Speed: while ApplyCalleeStores replays the callee's body events, ClassParam
reads a table of each parameter's root and view class (the replay rebinds
no parameter; debug builds compare every answer with ClassParam), and
classat hands the found parameter to MapClassAt instead of MapClass
searching for it again.

